    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmHqLtNE9E62ot_y6le9F6R_j9qo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 深圳工作+度假，十天减掉2公斤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 旧的不去新的不来，感谢@木头lancer 送 Find X6 Pro</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 前疫情时代跟 OPPO 合作挺多的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 这个手机我最爱的一点，内置 Google 服务框架！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 我一直都很喜欢用手机拍长焦的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 拍了好几天才知道只有相机的手动专业模式才是风格化的哈苏影调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 手机选择终极问题：要一个能拍照的手机还是能打电话的相机</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxtNVyhFHe6j2EfR82hbnABVMHE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbYInzDNo6yRzvZ9r2M3J6AdpHz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsZXu7vRRxc7wJcaDyKCfkD116qK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2vaNjSNlt65yTLTge4B0Foi2gk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrhStIOMKHjsgYR26ymyYKbrqWfY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这是一档管牧的个人播客，数码，运动，育儿，旅行，读书......</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的博客：www.guanmu.name</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的微博/B站：@AndrewGuan</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的 Instagram：@guanmu</span></p>]]></description>
